<title>FRANCE: EU grants free market wheat, barley exports.</title>
<headline>EU grants free market wheat, barley exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted the following free-market grain exports, officials said.</p>
<p>(Taxes or refunds in Ecus per tonne).</p>
<p>		  Tonnage     Minimum Tax     Maximum Refund</p>
<p> Soft wheat   85,000	   0.10		 None</p>
<p> Barley	 75,500	    -		   9.90</p>
<p>There had been bids for soft wheat based on taxes between 0.10 Ecus and 1.50 Ecus, French authorities said earlier.</p>
</text>
